SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The uuuuddeeccooddee and uuuueennccooddee utilities are compliant with the IEEE Std
     1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”) specification.

     The flags [--cciipprrss] are extensions to that specification.

     The use of the --oo flag for uuuueennccooddee and the --mm flag for uuuuddeeccooddee are also
     extensions to that specification.

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The uuuuddeeccooddee and uuuueennccooddee utilities appeared in 4.0BSD.

BBUUGGSS
     Files encoded using the traditional algorithm are expanded by 35% (3
     bytes become 4 plus control information).

